{"kind":"request","text":"Claude: keep the CLI on the resident's projection when the full status outgrows 64 MiB.\n\nhugh asked on 2026-10-16 why landing in the artroom workroom still takes so long, and approved filing this.\n\nOn 2026-10-16 the artroom resident's /v0/status is 71,266,293 bytes at depth 43,744. The CLI's limit is 64 MiB (fullResponseLimit, cmd/gs/main.go:2704@5876d211; the MCP adapter has the same, cmd/gitseq-mcp/main.go:64@5876d211). So every step command under --server prints \"resident projection unavailable (resident response exceeds 67108864 bytes)\" and verifies the whole log locally, which takes about 42 s per command (measured with gs land on a copy). In September the status was 52 MB at depth 23,500, so it grows with the log, and a fixed byte cap will be crossed again.\n\nOutcome. A step command under --server gets the projection it needs from the resident at any log depth this machine can fold, under the same frontier validation as today. The local audit stays the stated fallback. Raising the cap alone does not satisfy this. The fix is to fetch only what the command reads, or to stream the snapshot without one in-memory size limit, or another design that removes the cliff.","body":{"conditions":"1. gs land, gs artifact, gs review-request, gs promise, gs work --next and the preflights of state, batch, ratify and supersede under --server use the resident's projection when its full status exceeds 64 MiB, with the existing frontier validation and local-audit fallback; a test with a projection over the old limit goes red if the command falls back. 2. The MCP adapter's full-status path is fixed the same way or the report says why it does not need to be. 3. Memory use of the client is bounded or stated; the report names the peak RSS of gs land against the artroom copy. 4. go test ./... passes at the head. 5. The report states the before and after time of opening a step session against a copy of the artroom log.","target_head":"5876d2118fa3d9d223dfc923744bc0bb9ef1dfc0","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8","to":"a5d35aa7e4799472a208663d7f024917442bd513929f9eccf450628ccf70095d"}}